# Reproduction for bd inc-6sm3, part (a): the use-skill menu (U) must not list
# Appraise, Decipher Script or Escape Artist. Before the fix they were listed
# (Player::ActiveTraits, src/Tables.cpp), and picking one printed "That skill
# isn't implemented yet." (src/Skills.cpp UseSkill default).
#
# Read by tools/check_use_menu_skills.sh, which loads the kobold rogue fixture
# (tools/fixtures/chars/kobold-rogue-seed1.sav; he has all three skills) with
# INCURSION_LOAD, so the session starts in play and the first key is a game
# command. @expect stops the run (exit 6) if the menu never opened.
u
@expect "Use which skill, feat or ability?"
@dump:use-menu
ESC
@quit
